# GAMDIAS BOREAS digital display (boreas-display-linux).
# MODE 0666 so it also works from remote/headless sessions and the systemd user
# service (uaccess alone only covers the active local seat). The device only
# accepts 4-digit display frames.
SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="1b80", ATTRS{idProduct}=="b53a", MODE="0666", TAG+="uaccess"
SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="1b80", ATTRS{idProduct}=="b554", MODE="0666", TAG+="uaccess"
